{"quest_id": 4422, "name": "ゴブリンアーマー", "description": "女神の神殿前で魔物に襲われている\n聖霊を見つけた王子たち。\n魔物を倒し、聖霊を救え！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "光と闇の聖霊", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920055, "map_no": 5385, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 15, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 12, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 16, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 720, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 720, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2103216, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 262, "global_id": 261, "spawn_sec": 37}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 73}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 180, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 180, "damage_type": "magical", "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 80, "attack_interval": 231, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098032, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 69, "global_id": 68, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 90}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 156, "move_speed": 370.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097792, "master_id": 9, "spawn_sec": 110}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "？？？", "text": "あと少しで女神アイギス様の神殿に\nたどり着くはずだ……。\nそこまで行けばきっと……！", "face": "u303"}, {"name": "魔物", "text": "ギャギャ！　逃ガサナイ……！", "face": "l6d57084cbee7"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "愚かな……。逃げられないのは貴様たちの方だ。\nここがどこなのか、そのくすんだ目で\nよく見てみることだ。", "face": "u303"}, {"name": "魔物", "text": "コ、ココハ女神神殿の森！\nタ、タイキャク……。", "face": "l6d57084cbee7"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、あそこに人……、いえ聖霊でしょうか。\n魔物に襲われているようです。", "face": "le29c9a406493"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "さあ、現世代の英雄がいかほどのものか\n見せてもらいましょう。", "face": "u303"}]}, {"trigger": "battle", "at_sec": 41, "lines": [{"name": "山賊", "text": "お、なんだあの魔物。\n魔物のくせに固そうな鎧を着てやがんなぁ。", "face": "u4"}, {"name": "山賊", "text": "王子、鎧を叩き潰すのは得意分野だ。\nあいつの相手はあっしらに任せてくだせぇ。", "face": "u4"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "もう大丈夫ですよ。\nお怪我はありませんか？"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "ありがとう。助かった。", "face": "u303"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "えっと……、神殿になにか御用があったのですか？", "face": "le29c9a406493"}, {"name": "？？？", "text": "女神アイギス様に、\n力を貸してもらいたいことがあってな。", "face": "u303"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "よろしければ詳しい話を\nお聞かせいただけませんか？\nなにかお力になれるかもしれません。"}]}], "active": true}